  "question": {
    "text": "An object is taken to a height above the surface of earth at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>R</mi></math> from the centre of the earth. Where radius of earth, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math>. The percentage decrease in the weight of the object will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>64</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Acceleration due to gravity at&nbsp;height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>For distance from the centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi></math></p><p>Change in weight&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p>Percentage change&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
